ng among alternatives for solvent selection using defined performance, service, design, and constraint criteria. Within Liquid-Liquid Extraction, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of solvent selection within Mass Transfer Operations, particularly where the Liquid-Liquid Extraction module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of solvent selection, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'solvent selection; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of solvent selection, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Mass Transfer Operations', 'Active'), ('KCR_000708', 'psychrometrics', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Mass Transfer Operations', 'Technical Concept', 'psychrometrics in Mass Transfer Operations concerns the analysis of moist-air properties and processes using quantities such as dry-bulb temperature, humidity ratio, relative humidity, enthalpy, and dew point.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of psychrometrics within Mass Transfer Operations, particularly where the Humidification and Drying module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of psychrometrics, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'psychrometrics in Mass Transfer Operations concerns the analysis of moist-air properties and processes using quantities such as dry-bulb temperature, humidity ratio, relative humidity, enthalpy, and dew point. Within Humidification and Drying, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of psych